Subject: [PATCH 2435/3799] soh: rename func_80ADF15C -> EnPoh_Dissolve

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: rings EffectSsDeadDb outward as the body breaks up, ending with NA_SE_EN_PO_DEAD2
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Poh/z_en_poh.c
